<title>USA: Gillette Co Q1 shr increases.</title>
<headline>Gillette Co Q1 shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Call mean estimate for Q1 was $0.51 per share.</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.51		    $0.45</p>
<p> Net			283,700		  249,300</p>
<p> Sales		  2,180,000		2,058,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 556,680		  552,168</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
